### consuming the service document describe what are the entities part of service
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService

### metadata document of the odata service
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/$metadata

### read my all employee data
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet
Authorization: Basic govardhan:raju

### read only the revelent fields from all employee  using(SELECT)
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$select=nameFirst,loginName,salaryAmount

### get the total count of employee record using(COUNT)
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/$count

### pagination load data chunk by chunk for performance  using(TOP,SKIP)
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$top=2&$skip=2

### load a single employee by key
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/055d970e-26d2-4577-b1d1-72fa98e34a30

### how to filter the data based on condition using(FILTER)
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$filter=bankName eq 'State Bank of India'

### can we filter data based on pattern match
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$filter=contains(nameFirst,'G')

### sorting the data using(orderby)
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$orderby=salaryAmount desc

### load all purchaseorder data
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet

### get single purchaser order data
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet/PO00007

### get items data for particular order
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet/PO00007/Items

### load order herader  of single order + its all items together  using (EXAPND)
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet/PO00007?$expand=Items

### using CDS views we do lazy loading
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CDSService/ProductSet/PROD00001?$expand=To_Items

### create operation to insert data into database 
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic raju:govardhan

{
  "nameFirst": "Vengalaraju",
  "nameMiddle": "Govardhana",
  "nameLast": "Raju",
  "nameIntials": "V",
  "sex": "M",
  "language": "E",
  "phoneNumber": "6174031439",
  "email": "gova.raju@company-us.com",
  "loginName": "gova1",
  "Currency_code": "USD",
  "salaryAmount": "1000000",
  "accountNumber": "1026031120061605",
  "bankId": "BNPA8714",
  "bankName": "State Bank of India"
}

### change (updatacall) copy the id created in last call

PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/cb28bbfa-ed4f-46ff-a93a-db4bfcebd59d
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "salaryAmount": "1999999" 
}

### delete the data from db
DELETE http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/cb28bbfa-ed4f-46ff-a93a-db4bfcebd59d

